# Check every text file out with LF on every platform.
#
# Two things in this repo read their own source bytes back and compare them:
# the journal and pipeline HTML renderers `include_str!` their CSS and JS and
# are diffed byte-for-byte against golden output, and one UI test includes a
# source file to assert on it. A CRLF checkout — which is what Git does by
# default on Windows — changes those bytes and fails the tests for a reason
# that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf
